  "prefLabel": "Agr 503.10 Information About Maple Syrup and Maple Flavored Products",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 503.10 Information About Maple Syrup and Maple Flavored Products.\n\n(a) The information submitted about maple syrup shall include the New Hampshire grade, if known.\n\n(b) The information submitted about maple flavored products shall comply with RSA 429:16, II and III.\n\nSource. #9616, eff 12-22-09",
